 -nocheck NUMSUF -nocheck OLDALW -nocheck PRMBSE -nocheck PRMVAL -nocheck PRTCNT -nocheck SEPLIN -nocheck STYVAL -nocheck UCCONN
 -nocheck CLKINF -nocheck DALIAS -nocheck DIFCLK -nocheck EXPIPC -nocheck FDTHRU -nocheck FFASRT -nocheck FSMIDN -nocheck INFNOT
 -nocheck IPRTEX -nocheck NUMDFF -nocheck ONPNSG -nocheck PRMEXP -nocheck TPOUNR -nocheck USEPAR -nocheck USEPRT
 -nocheck BADFSM -nocheck CBPAHI -nocheck EXTFSM -nocheck IFSMCD -nocheck IGNDLY -nocheck INDXOP -nocheck LOOPTM -nocheck LRGOPR
 -nocheck MEMSIZ -nocheck MICAWS -nocheck MXFNOT -nocheck PADMSB -nocheck POIASG -nocheck RDOPND -nocheck REDOPR -nocheck REVROP
 -nocheck SHFTNC -nocheck SLNOTP -nocheck SYNASN -nocheck SYNPRT -nocheck TRNMBT -nocheck TROPCZ -nocheck TRUNCZ -nocheck TSETGV
 -nocheck TUSEGV -nocheck VLGMEM
"
